{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<link href=\"https://hangeul.pstatic.net/hangeul_static/css/nanum-myeongjo.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<link href=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/web_font/nexon_gothic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style type=\"text/css\">/* 기본 */\r\n            .font_NMr {font-family:'NanumMyeongjo' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMeb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NGL {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light' !important;}\r\n            .font_NGB {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Bold' !important;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap * {box-sizing:border-box;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:break-word;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd, p, div, span, section, i, form, fieldset, input, table, tr, th, td, button, textarea, br {margin:0;padding:0;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap i {font-style:normal;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd {list-style:none;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap img {width:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;width:100%;max-width:1200px !important;font-weight:400;margin:0 auto;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:-0.05em;-webkit-letter-spacing:-0.25px;text-align:center;color:#626262;line-height:1.4;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT SIZE CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap p {transform:rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p0 {font-size:1.1667em;}/*14px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {font-size:1.3333em;}/*16px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {font-size:1.5em;}/*18px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {font-size:2em;}/*24px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {font-size:2.6667em;}/*32px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {font-size:4em;}/*48px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {font-size:6.6667em;}/*80px*/\r\n\r\n            /* FONT STYLE CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .fw_600 {font-weight:600;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_10 {line-height:1;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_12 {line-height:1.2;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ta_l {text-align:left;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ta_r {text-align:right;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .t_up {text-transform:uppercase;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT COLOR CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_white {color:#fff;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_gray {color:#424242;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_dark {color:#121212;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_blue {color:#0068b7;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_lightblue {color:#d3edfb}\r\n\r\n            /* BG COLOR CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_white {background-color:#fff;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_whitegray {background-color:#f9f9f9;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_gray {background-color:#eeeeee;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_black {background-color:#000;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_dark {background-color:#313131;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_blue {background-color:#0068b7;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_lightblue {background-color:#f4fafe;}\r\n\r\n            /* MARGIN CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_02em {margin-top:0.2em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_03em {margin-top:0.3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_04em {margin-top:0.4em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_1em {margin-top:1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_15em {margin-top:1.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {margin-top:10px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {margin-top:20px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {margin-top:30px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {margin-top:50px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {margin-top:70px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_100 {margin-top:100px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_120 {margin-top:120px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {margin-top:150px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_200 {margin-top:200px;}\r\n\r\n            /* PADDING CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_70 {padding-top:70px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_80 {padding-top:80px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_3em {padding-bottom:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_70 {padding-bottom:70px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:80px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_5p {padding:5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_1em {padding:1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_2em {padding:2em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .plr_5p {padding:0 5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .plr_8p {padding:0 8%;}\r\n            \r\n            /* GRID · FLEX 스타일 */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_1step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:32%;justify-content:center;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_2step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 32%);justify-content:center;gap:1.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_3step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 32%);justify-content:center;gap:1.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_textList {display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.4167em auto;justify-content:center;align-items:start;gap:1.25em;}\r\n            /* flex study : 목록형 텍스트 -----------------------------------------------------\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .textList > p:nth-of-type(odd) {flex:0 0 4%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .textList > p:nth-of-type(even) {flex:1 1 96%;}\r\n            ------------------------------------------------------------------ */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_ss {display:flex;justify-content:start;align-items:start;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_cs {display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:start;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_cc {display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_wrap {flex-wrap: wrap;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .cgap_1em {column-gap:1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .rgap_1em {row-gap:1em;}\r\n\r\n            /* 기타 스타일 */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w75 {width:75%;margin-left:12.5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w84 {width:84%;margin-left:8%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w90 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pos_r {position:relative;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mWidth_10 {max-width:10% !important;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10 {border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10v {border-radius:10px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_topRound {border-radius:300px 300px 0 0;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .gray_linebox {border:1px #d2d2d2 solid;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .blue_linebox {border:1px #0068b7 solid;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lightblue_linebox {border:0.25em #d3edfb solid;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .title_bar {position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -50%);border-radius:300px;padding:0.7em 2em 0.6em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_bar {display:inline-block;min-width:4em; border-radius:300px;padding:0.5em 1.5em 0.4em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .blue_linebar {border-radius:300px;border:#0068b7 1px solid;padding:0.7em 1.2em 0.6em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .txtList_dotline {border-bottom:#ccc dotted 1px;margin-bottom:1.5em;padding:0 0.5em 1.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .underline:after {content:'';width:100%;position:absolute;bottom:-1px;left:0;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {display:none;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {display:block;}\r\n\r\n            /* 타이틀 */\r\n            .Product_Title .ProductName i {background-color:#fff;padding:0 1em;}\r\n            .Product_Title .ProductName::after {content: '';position:absolute;display:block;width:100%;height:1px;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -2px);background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#d9d9d9 20%,#d9d9d9 80%,#fff 100%);z-index:-1;}\r\n            .NumberBox {display:inline-block;padding:0.5em 0.684em 0.4em;border-radius:150px;background-color:#121212;}\r\n\r\n            /* 키이미지 */\r\n            .KeyImg .key_TitleBox {position:absolute;top:10%;}\r\n            .Top_Text span {position:relative;font-weight:600;}\r\n            .Top_Text span:after {content:'';position:absolute;display:block;width:0.15em;height:0.15em;line-height:0;border-radius:100px;top:-0.3em;left:52%;transform:translateX(-50%);background-color:#0068b7;}\r\n\r\n            /* 제품 특징 */\r\n            .KeyPoint_Box {background:linear-gradient(#f7f8f8 75%, #fff 75%);}\r\n            .KeyPoint_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto;justify-content:center;gap:2.5em;}\r\n\r\n            /* 복합 히알루론산 */\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:27.5% auto;justify-content:center;column-gap:1em;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Img p {position:absolute;width:88.2155%;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Img p:nth-child(1) {top:23%;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Img p:nth-child(2) {top:54%;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Img p:nth-child(3) {top:80%;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_rowGrid {display:grid;grid-template-rows:35% 33.5% auto;justify-content:start;align-items:start;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_GIF {display:grid;grid-template-columns:30% 30%;justify-content:space-evenly;}\r\n\r\n            /* 복합 히알루론산 효과 */\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Graph {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5, 9%);justify-content:center;column-gap:5em;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Graph .gradient_color {height:21em;background:linear-gradient(#0068b7, #d3edfb);border-top:1px #fff solid;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Graph .graph_mask {position:absolute;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;mix-blend-mode:screen;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Graph .h94 {width:100%;height:94%;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Graph .h92 {width:100%;height:92%;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Graph .h81 {width:100%;height:81%;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Graph .h79 {width:100%;height:79%;}\r\n            .Hyaluronic_Graph .h73 {width:100%;height:73%;}\r\n\r\n            /* 펩타이드 4종 */\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p {position:absolute;}\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p:nth-of-type(1) {top:16.5%;right:68.2327%;}\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p:nth-of-type(2) {top:35.1%;right:72.0358%;}\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p:nth-of-type(3) {top:53.5%;right:72.0358%;}\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p:nth-of-type(4) {top:72.4%;right:68.2327%;}\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p:nth-of-type(5) {top:19.3%;left:69.5749%;}\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p:nth-of-type(6) {top:37.6316%;left:73.1544%;}\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p:nth-of-type(7) {top:56.0526%;left:73.1544%;}\r\n            .ActivePep_Solution p:nth-of-type(8) {top:74.4%;left:69.5749%;}\r\n\r\n            /* 6가지 유기농 식물 추출물 */\r\n            .Extract_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 30%);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:4em;}\r\n            .Extract_Grid li:after {content:'';position:absolute;display:block;width:1px;height:75%;border-right:1px #3d8cc8 dotted;bottom:0;right:-8%;}\r\n            .Extract_Grid li:nth-child(3n):after {display:none;}\r\n\r\n            /* 어떤 부분이 달라졌을까요 */\r\n            .Renewal_Grid li > div {width:90%;margin:0 5%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 20% 1fr;border-bottom:1px #727272 dotted;}\r\n            .Renewal_Grid li:nth-child(1) {border-bottom:2px #0068b7 solid;}\r\n            .Renewal_Grid li:nth-child(1) > div, .Renewal_Grid li:last-of-type > div {border-bottom:none;}\r\n            .Renewal_Grid li:nth-child(n+2) {background-color:#fff;}\r\n            .Renewal_Grid p {padding:1.2em 1em 1em;color:#424242;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}\r\n            .Renewal_Grid li:nth-child(1) p {padding:0.6em 0.5em;background-color:transparent;}\r\n            .Renewal_Grid p:nth-child(2) {background-color:#f9f9f9;font-weight:600;color:#121212;}\r\n            .Renewal_Grid p:nth-child(3) {color:#0068b7;font-weight:600;}\r\n\r\n            /* 건강한 피부 정보 */\r\n            .SkinMoisture_Box {background:linear-gradient(#f9f9f9 85%, #fff 85%);}\r\n            .SkinMoisture {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 15.2593%);justify-content:center;column-gap:7em;}\r\n            .SkinMoisture li {z-index:2;}\r\n            .SkinMoisture:nth-of-type(2):after {content:'';position:absolute;display:block;width:50%;height:1px;border-top:1px #3c8cc9 dotted;top:50%;left:25%;z-index:1;}\r\n            .SkinMoisture .arrow:after {content:'';position:absolute;width: 0;top:50%;right:-40%;height:0;border:5px solid transparent;border-top:5px solid #0068b7;border-right:5px solid #0068b7;transform:translate(-100%, -50%) rotate(45deg);}\r\n            .SkinMoisture_cause {width:fit-content;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto;justify-content:center;align-items:start;column-gap:2em;margin:1.8em auto 0 !important;}\r\n            .SkinMoisture_cause li {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6667em auto;justify-content:start;align-items: start;padding:1.5em 2em;column-gap:1em;}\r\n            .SkinMoisture_cause:after {content:'';position:absolute;display:block;width:100%;height:1px;border-top:1px #3c8cc9 dotted;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -51%);}\r\n            .SkinMoisture_cause li:nth-child(odd):after {content:'';position:absolute;display:block;width:1px;height:100%;border-right:1px #3c8cc9 dotted;top:0;right:-1em;transform:translateY(-0.5px);}\r\n\r\n            /* 케어셀라 하이드레이션 */\r\n            .HydrationSet_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5, 18%);justify-content:space-around;}\r\n            .HydrationSet_Grid img {width:7.5em;}\r\n            .HydrationSet_Grid li {z-index:2;}\r\n            .HydrationSet_Grid:nth-of-type(2):after {content:'';position:absolute;display:block;width:80%;height:1px;border-top:1px #656565 dotted;top:50%;left:10%;z-index:1;}\r\n\r\n            /* 브랜드 스토리 */\r\n            .Brand_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 56%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#ccc solid 1px;text-align:left;}\r\n            .Brand_Grid .logo_img {max-width:40% !important;margin-top:1em;}\r\n\r\n            /* 각종인증사항 */\r\n            .Certifi_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:15% 82%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#cccc solid 1px;}\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1200px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {margin-top:0.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {margin-top:1.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {margin-top:2.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {margin-top:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {margin-top:5.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_100 {margin-top:8.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_120 {margin-top:10vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {margin-top:12.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_200 {margin-top:16.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pt_70 {padding-top:5.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pt_80 {padding-top:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_70 {padding-bottom:5.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10, .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10v {border-radius:0.8333vw;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1020px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:10px;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p0 {font-size:1.4em;}/*14px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {font-size:1.6em;}/*16px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {font-size:1.8em;}/*18px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {font-size:2.4em;}/*24px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {font-size:3.2em;}/*32px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {font-size:4.8em;}/*48px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {font-size:7em;}/*80px*/\r\n                .grid_textList img {margin-top:0.2em;}\r\n                .Hyaluronic_rowGrid {margin-top:-0.3em !important;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:920px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:9px;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .w75, .Product_DetailWrap .w84 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {display:block;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {display:none;}\r\n                .SkinMoisture .arrow:after {border:3px solid transparent;border-top:3px solid #0068b7;border-right:3px solid #0068b7;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:820px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:8px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:7px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:620px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:6px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:510px) {\r\n                .Brand_Grid {grid-template-columns:1fr;row-gap:4.1667vw;text-align:center;}\r\n                .Brand_Grid .logo_img {margin-top:0 !important;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:520px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:5px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:420px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:4px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:320px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:3px;}\r\n            }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"Product_DetailWrap\">\n<section class=\"KeyImg pos_r\">\n<div class=\"key_TitleBox w90\">\n<p class=\"p4\">한 병에 담은 수분 에너지<br/>\r\n수분과 영양이 가득한 촉촉한 발림성의 겔 타입 세럼</p>\n<p class=\"p6 color_dark font_NGB mt_02em lh_12\">케어셀라 하이드레이션<br/>\r\n인텐시브 세럼</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/HYDRATION/intensive_serum/hydration_intensive_serum_keyimg.jpg\"/></section>\n<p class=\"Top_Text p4 color_blue\"><span>수</span> <span>분</span> <span>촉</span> <span>촉</span><br/>\r\n레이어링 하면 할 수록 촉촉하게 차오르는 수분감</p>\n\n<div class=\"Product_Title mt_150\">\n<p class=\"ProductName pos_r font_NMr t_up lh_12\"><i>CareCella</i></p>\n<p class=\"font_NMr t_up lh_12\">Hydration Intensive Serum</p>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NGB color_dark mt_04em\">제품 특징</p>\n<p class=\"p1 font_NMr mt_04em\">KEY POINT</p>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"KeyPoint_Box mt_50\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/HYDRATION/intensive_serum/hydration_intensive_serum_img_01.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"w90 KeyPoint_Grid plr_5p bg_white ta_l\">\n<div class=\"font_NMr p6 color_lightblue lh_10\">01</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 color_dark\">촉촉 수분 보습막 형성 블렌딩 포뮬라를 함유한<br/>\r\n투명 수분 세럼에 담은 신개념 집중 앰플형 세럼</p>\n<p class=\"p3 mt_02em\">여러 번 덧발라도 뭉치거나 밀리지 않는 촉촉한 발림성의 겔 타입 앰플형 세럼<br/>\r\n속 건조를 잡고 싶을 때 레어이링 하여 사용하면 피부에 수분 보습감을 오래 정착 가능<br/>\r\n미백 주름 개선 2중 기능성</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"font_NMr p6 color_lightblue lh_10\">02</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 color_dark\">무너진 장벽이 남긴 흔적을 지우는 세럼</p>\n<p class=\"p3 mt_02em\">수분 하